stricted to project outputs, workspace \\"\\n                  f\\"data, uploaded documents, and presentation output.\\")\\n\\ndef mkdir(directory_path: str) -> str:\\n    \\"\\"\\"Create a directory (and any missing parents) inside the workspace sandbox.\\n\\n    Args:\\n        directory_path: Path of the directory to create\\n    \\"\\"\\"\\n    resolved, error = _resolve_sandbox_path(directory_path)\\n    if error:\\n        return error\\n    resolved.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\n    return f\\"Created directory '{directory_path}'\\"", "args_schema": {"directory_path": {"type": "string", "description": ""}}}	{"type": "object", "properties": {"directory_path": {"type": "string", "description": ""}}, "required": ["directory_path"]}	string	\N	t	t	builtin-seeder	f	\N	0	\N	0	\N	1.0.0	\N	filesystem	t	\N	["builtin", "filesystem"]	2026-08-15 08:02:47.985672+00	2026-08-15 08:05:00.518207+00	{"category": "filesystem", "order": 13, "section": null, "is_concurrency_safe": true, "output_schema": null, "guard": {"approval": false, "confirmation": false}, "presentation": {}}
